Rule 29 (list of floats for weights must match length of a tensor dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(float)} |= v_2.len = shape(v_1, 0) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : v_2[i] ≥ 0

Rule 5 (index tensor (v_2) should be within the range of input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= min(v_2) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : max(v_2) ≤ shape(v_1, i) − 1

Rule 8 (tensor must have an integer dtype: 1–5)
